  abilityDesc: 28 combo massive Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), enormously reduces damage taken for 3 turns, enormously boosts max HP, enormously
    boosts Atk, Def relative to max HP for 3 turns, fully restores HP for 3 turns
    & raises allies from KO
